~ start
John: [[Greetings!|Zdraztvitķe!|Labas Dienas!]] You have come to my church.
John: Even though i am the supreme leader, i can afford to spare you some time.
=> selection

~ selection
John: Now, what is it that you came to tell me?
- I wish to leave
	John: ... ok.
	$> Global.action=""
- Teach me how to defend myself! [if !Global.combat_unlocked /]

	John: You have been granted the power of punching your enemies until they die!
	$> Global.combat_unlocked=true
	=> selection
- I've heard you're selling some better cards. [if Global.combat_unlocked /]
	John: Mmm... So you have... 
	John: I've aqquired a couple from a... world beyond this one..
	John: Wouldn't call them quite... Exotic...
	John: But you won't find these ones anywhere else.
	$> Global.transition_to_scene("res://location_scenes/Riga/Church of John/John Shop/shop.tscn")
	=> start
- I have outgrown you, sensei! [if Global.combat_unlocked and !("John Politician" in Global.enemies_defeated) /]
	John: JUNIOR! 
	John: You are courting death!
	$> Global.pre_combat_scene="res://location_scenes/Riga/Church of John/church.tscn"
	$> Global.start_combat(["John Politician"])
=> END

